alogue, mutual respect, and belonging to support educational excellence and student success. Through academic programs, student organizations and activities, faculty initiatives, and community partnerships, we encourage meaningful engagement with diverse perspectives. As a higher education institution, we are dedicated to advancing knowledge and empowering individuals to reach their full potential by prioritizing inclusive curriculum development, faculty and staff training, student mentorship, and comprehensive support programs. At CSUB, excellence is built on merit, talent, diversity, accessibility, and equal opportunity for all. Advertised: October 01, 2026 (9:00 AM) Pacific Daylight Time Applications close: Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Ok, we will send you jobs like this. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Open Date Close Date Assistant Professor of Mathematics (Pure Mathematics) Bakersfield October 01, 2026 The Department of Mathematics at California State University, Bakersfield invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the rank of Assistant Professor. Current Opportunities Position Location Open Date Close Date Assistant Professor of Mathematics (Pure Mathematics) Bakersfield October 01, 2026 The Department of Mathematics at California State University, Bakersfield invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the rank of Assistant Professor. Powered by PageUp If you have any questions, encounter problems, or need assistance, please email us. For Staff/Management positions, email jobs@csub.edu . For Faculty positions, email facultyaffairs@csub.edu . 9001 Stockdale Highway Bakersfield, CA 93311 (661) 654-CSUB Academics Antelope Valley Campus College of Arts and Humanities