he academic term. Current Opportunities Position Location Open Date Close Date 2026-27 Lecturer Pool Department of Management/Marketing (Supply Chain Management) Bakersfield August 03, 2026 The Department of Management/Marketing is collecting application materials for a pool of lecturers with positions available as determined by need during the 2026-27 academic year.  Appointments from the lecturer pool are temporary and often made just prior to the start of the academic term. Powered by PageUp If you have any questions, encounter problems, or need assistance, please email us. For Staff/Management positions, email jobs@csub.edu . For Faculty positions, email facultyaffairs@csub.edu . 9001 Stockdale Highway Bakersfield, CA 93311 (661) 654-CSUB Academics Antelope Valley Campus College of Arts and Humanities College of Business and Public Administration College of Natural Sciences, Mathematics, and Engineering College of Social Sciences and Education Extended Education Library Students with Dependents Resources Budget Central Campus Directory Campus Forms Careers File Viewers Maps Safety Plan Security and Safety Reports Strategic Plan University Police Policies Accessibility Copyright (DMCA) Immigration Enforcement Policies Privacy Title IX `Runners on the Rise! Report a Website Issue © California State University, Bakersfield"
